  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 45,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 434.077, 466.0, 566.066, 526.353 ],
    "font" : "MyriadPro-It",
    "font size" : 11.0,
    "text color" : "[0.10201, 0.09019, 0.0941]",
    "content" : "(L-R) Special Projects Director Randy Stokes, Commissioner Marta Olchyk and Town Manager Mike Crotty join residents at the unveiling."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 48,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 36.0, 386.5, 296.909, 511.441 ],
    "font" : "MyriadPro-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.0,
    "text color" : "[0.10201, 0.09019, 0.0941]",
    "content" : "Joining the list of popular culinary establishments in the downtown district is Ike’s Diner, located at 9476 Harding Avenue. The Diner was created by a partnership between long-time restaurateur Samir Elnomany and Kosher Chef Yossi Horowitz. The diner serves breakfast all day, pastas, salads, pizzas, ﬁ sh, sandwiches, ice cream by the scoop and delicious iced coﬀ ees. Ike’s Diner is serving from 7:30 a.m. – 11 p.m. every day except Saturday. Home deliveries are available. For more information, call (305) 397-8559."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 44,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 312.0, 349.125, 574.009, 461.566 ],
    "font" : "MyriadPro-Regular",
    "font size" : 11.0,
    "text color" : "[0.10201, 0.09019, 0.0941]",
    "content" : "Isaac Bashevis Singer, a 1978 winner of the Nobel Prize for literature and a leading ﬁ gure in Yiddish literature, was a resident of the Town in the 1980s. Now the Surfside street named in his honor has new, more prominent signage. A brief ceremony attended by residents and Town o ﬃ cials marked the unveiling of the signs on 95th Street. In addition to the Nobel prize, Singer also won two National Book Awards for his novels and short story collections. He died on July 24, 1991."
  }, {
    "type" : "heading",
    "pdfua_tag" : "H4",
    "id" : 49,
    "level" : "Subtitle",
    "page number" : 1,
